# Renga (roadmap F-51): after login, a notification for each kernel crash
# report crash_collector saved and nobody has seen yet; clicking it opens
# the report in System logs. A background server (not in Deskbar) that
# quits when it is done. Only on images that have it.
target desktop {
	job x-vnd.Renga-CrashReportNotifier {
		launch /system/servers/crash_report_notifier
		if file_exists /system/servers/crash_report_notifier
		on initial_volumes_mounted
		no_safemode
	}
}
